  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation, Research and Learning (MERL) for EMPOWER Programme.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The consultancy project will be responsible for defining and collecting additional primary data and conduct rigours studies required for independent monitoring, evaluation, and results verification of the programme. It will also conduct qualitative and quantitative surveys throughout the programme, including cross-sectional surveys on beneficiary satisfaction and longitudinal surveys on outcomes of programme beneficiaries. It will contribute to supporting landscape analyses and provide an unbiased, evidence-based opinion to support decision making, including whether to pivot.</narrative>
  </description>
